WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.460 --> 00:00:03.462
- We used to be
a family of two.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.381
- Now look at us.

00:00:06.465 --> 00:00:08.967
- Here we are.
Yeah, it's pretty big out there.

00:00:09.051 --> 00:00:11.970
And I'm sure your head must be
filled with questions.

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:15.599
Now then, let's see...

00:00:17.226 --> 00:00:19.645
- Welcome to planet Earth.

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.897
There is much
to see and do here,

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:24.650
so let's get started
with a quick tour.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.360
♪ When I head off ♪

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.402
- Come on!

00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:28.779
♪ For new adventures ♪

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:31.615
- Life on Earth
is a wonderful thing.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.533
- Wow!

00:00:32.616 --> 00:00:36.954
- It looks big, but there are
lots of us on here.

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:40.123
We may all look different,
but don't be fooled.

00:00:40.958 --> 00:00:42.125
We are all people.

00:00:42.209 --> 00:00:43.168
- Hello!

00:00:43.252 --> 00:00:45.838
- And we all share the Earth.

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:51.510
- The world is so huge that...
no matter how much I learn,

00:00:51.593 --> 00:00:53.345
it'll never be enough!

00:00:53.428 --> 00:00:55.305
- It sounds like you feel...

00:00:55.389 --> 00:00:56.265
- Lost.

00:00:56.348 --> 00:00:59.309
- If you're feeling lost,
just start with what you know.

00:01:02.104 --> 00:01:03.272
- Hello, birds!

00:01:05.148 --> 00:01:06.316
Look at that!

00:01:12.281 --> 00:01:13.949
Wow!

00:01:18.871 --> 00:01:21.999
- There is so much more for you
to learn about planet Earth.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:25.878
Make sure you look after it,
as it's all we've got.

00:01:27.713 --> 00:01:30.632
- For the first time in his life,
he's speechless.

00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:36.138
♪ Remind myself
when I'm in the darkness ♪

